# Network mode's dev json-server data — mutated in place by every
# network-mode write, so it drifts from whatever's committed almost
# immediately; regenerate from the app's own schema with `pnpm db:init`
# (see server/generate-db.ts) instead of hand-editing or committing it.
server/db.json

# Empty dir `pnpm dev:server` creates so json-server's production-mode
# static middleware (it scans `./public` eagerly) has something to scan —
# see the dev:server note in AGENTS.md.
server/public/
